{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is your weapon. A sci-fi action roguelike and shmup combined, in Gunlocked 2 you'll pilot and upgrade a state-of-the-art warship against endless waves of deadly aliens. Deep customization, branching paths, and tons of unlockables offer endless replayability set against the infinity of outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/77a9acedb91f40d216e694b7aaf76611.poster.avif?t=1757343123\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/77a9acedb91f40d216e694b7aaf76611.webm?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/77a9acedb91f40d216e694b7aaf76611.mp4?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>What's New in the Sequel?</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Expanded Customization:</strong></u> More unique pilots, unlockable warships with their own strengths and weaknesses, and a hugely expanded upgrade system offer new creative freedom.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Mastery:</strong> Each pilot has masterful command over their starting weapon, giving them a unique weapon variant no other pilot has access to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot Skills:</strong> Pilots start with a unique ability, not tied to any equipment slots or weapons, giving them a flair all their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augments:</strong> Unlock and equip up to 6 ability modifiers before you start your run. Will you cover your weaknesses or lean into your strengths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilities:</strong> Discover common, uncommon, and rare upgrades that you can stack infinitely to create the perfect build. Make trades with special characters to refine your builds like never before.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/f83c4db2650af2bd752f292ba899893e.poster.avif?t=1757343123\" width=640 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/f83c4db2650af2bd752f292ba899893e.webm?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/f83c4db2650af2bd752f292ba899893e.mp4?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Refined Control:</strong></u> Every ship comes equipped with an active dodge ability for getting out of the most dangerous situations. Use the new &quot;Air Brake&quot; to make micro-adjustments to positioning when the bullets start flying. And 360-degree analog movement brings Gunlocked out of the retro era and firmly into the present.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Branching Paths:</u></strong> Periodically choose a warp gate and seamlessly jump to your chosen destination without ever pausing the gameplay. Different zones offer unique battles and rewards. Every run offers new choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/07d2ebecafce362b8edf50207cfe1193.poster.avif?t=1757343123\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/07d2ebecafce362b8edf50207cfe1193.webm?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/07d2ebecafce362b8edf50207cfe1193.mp4?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Modular Difficulty:</u></strong>\u00a0Activate any number of difficulty modifiers until you find the sweet spot for your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Glorious Pixel Art Revolution:</u></strong> Huge, full color sprites with detailed animations make every bullet, bomb, and laser explode with style. Gunlocked 2 is a massive leap forward in pixel art\u00a0 spectacle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/eaed53d7ee3f1acd7285025b0e73dff0d95f14fe.jpg"},{"name":"Money Magnet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/71cf966b3e60327fccaf9372855e8b5ecf3c27b5.jpg"},{"name":"Trash Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/a3adaba740785f0bbd34f8296c92759305a82c50.jpg"},{"name":"Smashteroid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/de6efe8f97e02e2f88dc8df3c9848335869574d9.jpg"},{"name":"Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/d3923663c30350e24b82b7df412d8d82b550fa98.jpg"},{"name":"Bug Hunt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/55ed76fcba94ac727a2cc896512b50bd230d65d9.jpg"},{"name":"Roll With It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/a530396aaabd83eef8982ac7c2e0e773c3c19d8b.jpg"},{"name":"Be Gone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/6853993c17110d16aa66694fbdd5dba6b82b50b4.jpg"},{"name":"Boosted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492830/d1bb181adcddbfd5698c2f45303bc6d1faf49886.jpg"},{"n