amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/f83c4db2650af2bd752f292ba899893e.mp4?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Refined Control:</strong></u> Every ship comes equipped with an active dodge ability for getting out of the most dangerous situations. Use the new &quot;Air Brake&quot; to make micro-adjustments to positioning when the bullets start flying. And 360-degree analog movement brings Gunlocked out of the retro era and firmly into the present.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Branching Paths:</u></strong> Periodically choose a warp gate and seamlessly jump to your chosen destination without ever pausing the gameplay. Different zones offer unique battles and rewards. Every run offers new choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/07d2ebecafce362b8edf50207cfe1193.poster.avif?t=1757343123\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/07d2ebecafce362b8edf50207cfe1193.webm?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492830/extras/07d2ebecafce362b8edf50207cfe1193.mp4?t=1757343123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Modular Difficulty:</u></strong>\u00a0Activate any number of difficulty modifiers until you find the sweet spot for your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Glorious Pixel Art Revolution:</u></strong> Huge, full color sprites with detailed animations make every bullet, bomb, and laser explode with style. Gunlocked 2 is a massive leap forward in pixel art\u00a0 spectacle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["FromLefcourt"],"genr